# Cookbook: the Myrddin-style BBS. Exercises system:global cmd_ dispatch, the
# prompt() -> on_body handoff (the next line of input is the post body, NOT a
# command), and round-tripping a post back out of the attr store.

> create
> tester
> secretpass
> secretpass
expect: Account created

> bb list
expect: Bulletin Boards
expect: general
expect-not: Huh?

> bb read general
expect: No posts

> bb post general=Test Title
expect: Type your post
> This is the body of my post.
expect: Posted to
expect-not: Huh?

> bb read general
expect: Test Title
> bb read general/1
expect: This is the body of my post.

> bb read nosuchboard
expect: No such board
